### Find Molecule by Synonym and Select Fields

Source: https://github.com/chembl/chembl_webresource_client/blob/master/demo_wrc.ipynb

Searches for molecules using their synonyms with a case-insensitive exact match and uses the `only` method to retrieve only the 'molecule_chembl_id'. This is useful when the preferred name is not known or fails.

```python
from chembl_webresource_client.new_client import new_client

molecule = new_client.molecule
mols = molecule.filter(molecule_synonyms__molecule_synonym__iexact='viagra').only('molecule_chembl_id')
mols
```

